  Slug: bloodline-diabolic
  DisplayName: 'Bloodline: Diabolic'
  IconPath: icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-symbol-eye-brown.webp
  Description: "Devils are evil with a silver tongue, and one of your ancestors dallied
    in darkness or made an infernal pact. Spell List divine Bloodline Skills Deception,
    Religion Sorcerous Gifts cantrip @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ignition],
    1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Charm], 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Floating
    Flame], 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enthrall], 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Suggestion],
    5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wave of Despair], 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truesight],
    7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Divine Decree], 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Divine
    Inspiration], 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Falling Stars] Bloodline
    Spells initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Diabolic Edict], advanced:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Embrace the Pit], greater: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hellfire
    Plume] Blood Magic\u2014Tongue of Flame Your tongue becomes laced with the fires
    of Hell, and you can either lash out at a foe with it or swallow it to make your
    lies more palatable. Either a target takes 1 fire damage per spell rank (if the
    spell already deals initial fire damage, combine this with the spell's initial
    damage before determining weaknesses and resistances), or you gain a +2 status
    bonus to Deception checks for 1 round. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect:
    Diabolic Blood Magic (Self)]"
